{"seq":2,"slug":"win-rate-root-cause","title":"胜诉率与败诉归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/chargeback-dispute-representment/dispute-case-ops/win-rate-root-cause","wordCount":1584,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"胜诉率与败诉归因\">胜诉率与败诉归因</h1><p>「胜诉率 62%」这句话本身没有信息量——分母是全部收到过的案件还是已裁决的案件？算不算超时未答复的？算不算你主动认赔的？口径不同，同一批数据可以得出 40% 到 75% 的结论。更要紧的是，胜诉率是一个<strong>结果指标</strong>，它告诉你发生了什么，但不告诉你该改什么。这一篇讲两件事：怎么把胜诉率定义得可用，以及怎么把败诉拆成<strong>可归因、可修复</strong>的缺陷类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-胜诉率的分母口径\">核心概念：胜诉率的分母口径</h2><p>先把三个容易混淆的概念分开：<strong>案件量</strong>、<strong>已裁决量</strong>、<strong>主动放弃量</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>有效胜诉率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>举证被接受数</mtext><mtext>已裁决数</mtext></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>已裁决数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>胜</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>负</mtext><mtext>证据不足</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>负</mtext><mtext>超时</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{有效胜诉率} = \\frac{\\text{举证被接受数}}{\\text{已裁决数}}, \\quad \\text{已裁决数} = \\text{胜} + \\text{负}_{\\text{证据不足}} + \\text{负}_{\\text{超时}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有效胜诉率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">已裁决数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">举证被接受数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">已裁决数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">胜</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">负</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">证据不足</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">负</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">超时</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>主动认赔的案件<strong>不进入分母</strong>：认赔是决策而不是失败，把它算进胜诉率会让你为了刷指标而不敢认赔，最终推高总成本。但认赔率必须单独监控——认赔率异常升高通常是「证据取不到」或「时限来不急」的代理指标。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>是否计入分母</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>举证被接受</td>\n<td>是（分子）</td>\n<td>真实胜利</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>举证被拒（证据不足）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>真实失败，可归因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时未答复</td>\n<td>是，但单独标记</td>\n<td>是流程失败而非证据失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主动认赔</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>决策，非失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预警阶段消解</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>从未形成拒付（见 sibling 预警篇）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仍在处理中</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>结果未定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>超时必须单独标记</strong>而不是简单计入失败，因为它的修法完全不同：证据不足要改举证策略，超时要改分派与时限计算（见 <a href=\"../chargeback-lifecycle/dispute-stage-deadline\">争议阶段与响应时限</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"按维度切分归因\">按维度切分归因</h2><p>一个总胜诉率不可行动，必须切分。</p>\n<h3 id=\"切分维度与陷阱\">切分维度与陷阱</h3><p>推荐的切分维度及其背后的假设：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>切分维度</th>\n<th>想回答的问题</th>\n<th>典型发现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原因码</td>\n<td>哪类主张我们系统性处理不好</td>\n<td>某欺诈类原因码胜率显著低于同类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证据类型</td>\n<td>哪类证据说服力不足</td>\n<td>仅有订单快照时胜率显著下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提交阶段</td>\n<td>是不是首次举证质量差</td>\n<td>representment 高、pre-arb 低说明首次举证不足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承运商/履约方式</td>\n<td>是否履约侧证据质量参差</td>\n<td>某承运商的妥投记录不可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>处理通道</td>\n<td>自动 vs 人工</td>\n<td>自动通道胜率反而低说明规则过宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商家</td>\n<td>是否存在系统性问题商家</td>\n<td>少数商家贡献多数败诉</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>切分的陷阱是<strong>多重比较</strong>：按六个维度各切十档就是六百个格子，总有一些格子看起来显著但其实是噪声。实用做法是只对<strong>样本量足够</strong>（例如每格 ≥30 件）的格子做结论，其余作为观察。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 按原因码 × 证据类型切分胜诉率（仅纳入已裁决案件）&#10;SELECT c.frozen_reason_code,&#10;       JSON_UNQUOTE(JSON_EXTRACT(e.items, &#39;$[0].kind&#39;)) AS primary_evidence_kind,&#10;       COUNT(*)                                   AS decided_cnt,&#10;       SUM(c.outcome = &#39;WON&#39;)                     AS won_cnt,&#10;       ROUND(SUM(c.outcome = &#39;WON&#39;) / COUNT(*), 3) AS win_rate,&#10;       SUM(c.outcome = &#39;LOST_TIMEOUT&#39;)            AS timeout_cnt&#10;FROM dispute_case c&#10;JOIN dispute_stage_timeline t&#10;  ON t.dispute_case_id = c.id AND t.stage = &#39;chargeback&#39;&#10;JOIN evidence_unit e ON e.dispute_case_id = c.id&#10;WHERE c.outcome IN (&#39;WON&#39;,&#39;LOST_EVIDENCE&#39;,&#39;LOST_TIMEOUT&#39;)&#10;  AND t.submitted_at IS NOT NULL&#10;GROUP BY 1, 2&#10;HAVING decided_cnt &gt;= 30&#10;ORDER BY win_rate ASC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按原因码 × 证据类型切分胜诉率（仅纳入已裁决案件）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">frozen_reason_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       JSON_UNQUOTE(JSON_EXTRACT(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$[0].kind'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> primary_evidence_kind,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decided_cnt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">outcome</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'WON'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> won_cnt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">outcome</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'WON'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> win_rate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">outcome</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'LOST_TIMEOUT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timeout_cnt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dispute_case c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dispute_stage_timeline t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dispute_case_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'chargeback'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> evidence_unit e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dispute_case_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">outcome</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'WON'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'LOST_EVIDENCE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'LOST_TIMEOUT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">submitted_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decided_cnt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> win_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>win_rate ASC</code> 让最差的组合排在最前——这正是归因的输出形式：一张<strong>按可改进程度排序的问题清单</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"败诉的四类根因\">败诉的四类根因</h2><p>把败诉拆成四类，每类对应完全不同的修复动作。这是这一篇最重要的一张表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>根因类</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>修复动作</th>\n<th>责任归属</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>证据不足</td>\n<td>提交了完整包但仍被拒</td>\n<td>改进证据类型组合/质量</td>\n<td>举证策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证据取不到</td>\n<td>案件进入 <code>EvidenceBlocked</code></td>\n<td>修上游系统集成或提前留存</td>\n<td>数据留存（见 sibling）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流程失败</td>\n<td><code>LOST_TIMEOUT</code> 或提交被拒后未重提</td>\n<td>修分派、时限计算、重试</td>\n<td>案件运营</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境不可控</td>\n<td>发卡行裁量或网络规则变动</td>\n<td>调整升级门槛，接受该损失</td>\n<td>预期内</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二与第三类的区分最关键，因为两者都表现为「我们没交出一份好材料」，但一个要改数据留存能力（交易时点快照、3DS 日志保留期），另一个要改运营流程。把它们混在一起统计，会得出「我们需要更多证据」的错误结论，而真实瓶颈可能是承运商接口只返回「已签收」而不返回签字地址。</p>\n<h3 id=\"归因要先于优化\">归因要先于优化</h3><p>常见的顺序错误是「先优化最贵的败诉类」。正确顺序是<strong>先归因、再按可修复性排序</strong>。一个金额很大但属于「环境不可控」的败诉类，投入产出比可能是零；一个金额不大但属于「证据取不到」的败诉类，修好一次会永久消除一整类损失。所以排序的键应该是：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"priority = 该根因类的年度损失金额 × 可修复性系数&#10;可修复性系数：证据取不到 1.0 &gt; 流程失败 0.9 &gt; 证据不足 0.5 &gt; 环境不可控 0.1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>priority = 该根因类的年度损失金额 × 可修复性系数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>可修复性系数：证据取不到 1.0 > 流程失败 0.9 > 证据不足 0.5 > 环境不可控 0.1</span></span></code></pre></div><p>系数是主观但必须显式的——把「不可控」的系数压低，能防止团队把资源投进注定无效的方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从归因到规则调整的闭环\">从归因到规则调整的闭环</h2><p>归因只有落成<strong>可验证的规则变更</strong>才算闭环。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四步闭环流程\">四步闭环流程</h3><p>一个完整闭环包含四步：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"1. 观测：某原因码下「仅有订单快照」的胜率 0.28，显著低于该码平均 0.61&#10;2. 假设：订单快照不足以证明履约，需要附妥投证明&#10;3. 变更：修改该原因码的证据配置（requires 增加 proof_of_delivery），&#10;        或修改组装器的关键证据判定（缺失即 BLOCKED 而非 DEGRADED）&#10;4. 验证：变更生效后同类案件的胜率变化，并设一个观察期&#10;   若胜率提升 &gt;= 阈值 -&gt; 确认；否则 -&gt; 回退该规则变更\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>1. 观测：某原因码下「仅有订单快照」的胜率 0.28，显著低于该码平均 0.61</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 假设：订单快照不足以证明履约，需要附妥投证明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 变更：修改该原因码的证据配置（requires 增加 proof_of_delivery），</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        或修改组装器的关键证据判定（缺失即 BLOCKED 而非 DEGRADED）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. 验证：变更生效后同类案件的胜率变化，并设一个观察期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   若胜率提升 >= 阈值 -> 确认；否则 -> 回退该规则变更</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第 4 步的<strong>回退</strong>常被省略。没有回退机制的规则变更是不可审计的——你无法区分「规则起作用了」和「这批案件本来就好打」。变更要版本化、要设观察期，这与本仓库「每一次规则收紧都可回退」的工程习惯一致。</p>\n<p>另外要注意<strong>归因数据本身的时效</strong>：网络规则与发卡行行为会漂移，一份基于半年前数据的胜率表可能已经失效。胜率表应当按滚动窗口（例如近 90 天）更新，并在数据量不足时退回到更宽的口径而不是给出噪声结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>胜诉率的分母必须是「已裁决案件」，主动认赔与预警消解不进分母，超时单独标记。</li>\n<li>认赔率要单独监控，它是证据/时限能力的代理指标。</li>\n<li>归因按原因码、证据类型、阶段、履约方式、通道、商家切分，只对样本足够的格子下结论。</li>\n<li>败诉分四类根因：证据不足、证据取不到、流程失败、环境不可控，修法完全不同。</li>\n<li>优化顺序是「年度损失 × 可修复性」，不是「损失金额」。</li>\n<li>每次规则变更要有观察期与回退路径，胜率表按滚动窗口更新。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[已裁决案件] --&gt; B{结果}&#10;  B --&gt;|胜| C[计入胜诉]&#10;  B --&gt;|证据不足| D[根因: 举证策略]&#10;  B --&gt;|超时/提交失败| E[根因: 流程失败]&#10;  B --&gt;|证据取不到| F[根因: 数据留存]&#10;  B --&gt;|裁量/规则变动| G[根因: 环境不可控]&#10;  D --&gt; H[按维度切分胜率]&#10;  E --&gt; H&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[按损失 x 可修复性排序]&#10;  I --&gt; J[修改证据配置/流程]&#10;  J --&gt; K{观察期胜率提升?}&#10;  K --&gt;|是| L[确认变更]&#10;  K --&gt;|否| M[回退变更]\">flowchart TD\n  A[已裁决案件] --&gt; B{结果}\n  B --&gt;|胜| C[计入胜诉]\n  B --&gt;|证据不足| D[根因: 举证策略]\n  B --&gt;|超时/提交失败| E[根因: 流程失败]\n  B --&gt;|证据取不到| F[根因: 数据留存]\n  B --&gt;|裁量/规则变动| G[根因: 环境不可控]\n  D --&gt; H[按维度切分胜率]\n  E --&gt; H\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[按损失 x 可修复性排序]\n  I --&gt; J[修改证据配置/流程]\n  J --&gt; K{观察期胜率提升?}\n  K --&gt;|是| L[确认变更]\n  K --&gt;|否| M[回退变更]</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"胜诉率与败诉归因","id":"胜诉率与败诉归因"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：胜诉率的分母口径","id":"核心概念-胜诉率的分母口径"},{"level":2,"text":"按维度切分归因","id":"按维度切分归因"},{"level":3,"text":"切分维度与陷阱","id":"切分维度与陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"败诉的四类根因","id":"败诉的四类根因"},{"level":3,"text":"归因要先于优化","id":"归因要先于优化"},{"level":2,"text":"从归因到规则调整的闭环","id":"从归因到规则调整的闭环"},{"level":3,"text":"四步闭环流程","id":"四步闭环流程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"争议案件工作流与分派","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/chargeback-dispute-representment/dispute-case-ops/case-workflow-assignment"},"next":{"title":"拒付率监控与网络阈值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/chargeback-dispute-representment/dispute-case-ops/chargeback-rate-monitor"}}